Z||000000||DiggityDan||06-02-2000||10:27 PM||||Hi..I'm working on getting a few people together to buy these sequential turn signals from Lawrence at WebElectric Magazine. He said he normally sells these kits for $59.95. If 5 people get involved, we get 10% off, 10 or more kits 15% off. If we get 10 people, that's almost $10.00 off. I'm not going to get anything off of this, I just want the sequential turn signals at the best possible price. So if you are interested, e-mail me at diggity_dan@hotmail.com<BR>I will put your name in a file and when we get enough responses I will inform everyone and we can work out all of the details.<BR>TIA<BR>Dan||||reg||1
