Z||000009||lawrence||06-05-2000||01:14 PM||||Motorhead and other interested parties,<P>There are several reasons why I sell at quantity discounts:<P>1) It helps cash flow.  When a large chunk of cash comes in, I can purchase more supplies (actually, help pay off the bills).<P>2) I like supporting car clubs, and I consider this a virtual club.  The members of a club help each other, and this is one way I can help.<P>3) I get one order, I pack up one box, and I make one trip to the Post Office.<P>For this group purchase, I can realize items 1) and 2), but yes, 3) will be difficult.  Although I would like to ship to a single address (probably Dan's) it isn't fair to burden him with all the shipping logistics.<P>So here's what I'll do.  Work with Dan to get a total order.  Dan can send me one order and a list of addresses.  Once I get the order, I'll send each kit to whoever ordered them (don't forget to include S&H when sending your money to Dan).  This way you all can get a kit, and I can at least only make a single trip to the Post Office -- writer's cramp from filling out labels not withstanding.<P>How does this sound?<P>-L<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe</A>  - WebElectric Magazine||||reg||1
Z||000010||Motorhead||06-05-2000||04:51 PM||||Lawrence,  you are truly a gentleman and a scholar!  Very attractive offer.<BR>Dan, E-mail your address, and money will be forthcoming if you are still interested in pursuing this.  I'll e-mail you to get on the list.<BR>Thanks to both Dan and Lawrence!||||reg||1
Z||000011||DiggityDan||06-05-2000||08:11 PM||||Ok........sorry I haven't been able to check this in a while. My motor went out this weekend and its left me with things to do. I am still interested in doing this. <P>We can arrange shipping either way, that's one thing that we all have to work out. I'm sure everyone will want it shipped directly to them. <P>As far as sending me money, DON'T SEND ME ANYTHING YET. I will e-mail everyone where to send there orders when the time comes. This is for your safety and mine. <P>So far there are 5 of us interested in this. I would like to get 5 more, this would give us a 10% discount. So if you have posted your name here or you are interested, Please e-mail me at diggity_dan@hotmail.com<BR>This is where I am keeping track of everyone. <P>When I get to ten, I am going to post a cut off day for orders. If you want them, e-mail me before the cut off day or you missed out. This is to gaurantee we all get our kits in a reasonable time. If I fill like we can't get 10 people, I will set a cut-off day anyways.<P>Lawrence, speaking of shipping, any ideas what it will run? Guesstimate is good for right now.<BR>Thanks for everyone involved on this. I'll keep everyone informed.<BR>Dan||||reg||1
