Z||000016||lawrence||06-07-2000||01:04 PM||||The STS-1 kit is for the notchback cars and will sequence up to three lights.<P>For the fastback, you'll need the STS-2 modules.  They, of course, only flash 2 lights and are used for cars with separate turn signals or for front sequentials.  See:<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe/sts/ststruck.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe/sts/ststruck.htm</A> <P>for more info, and:<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe/sts/stsclub.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe/sts/stsclub.htm</A> <P>for some of the vehicles that have these installed.  I also have them on the rear of my 88GT.<P>-L<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe</A>  - WebElectric Magazine||||reg||1
