Z||000020||lawrence||06-08-2000||07:52 AM||||That's correct.  There are fewer parts and less work for me to make.  Same discount applies.<P>-L <BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe</A>  - WebElectric Magazine||||reg||1
